   281	        unrecognised source file. `--no-renames` reports both sides.
   282	      * git C-quotes any name containing a newline or tab, and splitlines() then
   283	        tore that single path into two meaningless fragments. `-z` emits raw
   284	        names separated by NUL, so there is nothing to quote and nothing to tear.
